# Alexander, Ship's Fool ({3}{R}{W}), vigilance and haste: "{T}: Each player reveals the top card of their library,
# then draws a card. Alexander deals X damage to a random opponent, where X is the greatest mana value among cards
# revealed this way." Cast on turn 1 off two Moxen and Black Lotus, it taps the turn it enters (haste). Bot1 reveals
# Grizzly Bears (mana value 2) and Bot2 Serra Angel (mana value 5), so the greatest is 5 and Bot2 takes 5. Had each
# player drawn before revealing, the 0-mana Ornithopter under Grizzly Bears would have been revealed instead (CR 701.20,
# 121.2c), and X would be 0.

